--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0. WHICH LICENCE APPLIES TO WHAT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  SOURCE CODE  ->  MIT License (section 1)
      src/**            Python package (pipelines, models, evaluation, analysis)
      scripts/**        Preprocessing, training, evaluation, HPC and tooling scripts
      tests/**          Test suite
      config/**         Subject/group definition files
      run_tests.sh, requirements.txt, and any other build or tooling file

  DATA AND ANALYSIS OUTPUTS  ->  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (section 2)
      data/**           Derived per-subject-session feature tables
      results/**        Per-run training/evaluation records, aggregated tables,
                        figures, and every other analysis artefact
      DATADICTIONARY.md Documentation of the above

  THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL  ->  NOT covered by either licence (section 3)

Documentation under docs/** is covered by CC BY 4.0 (section 2), except for the
third-party files listed in section 3.


